          "message": {
            "text": "BioPassportRegistry._verifyMaterialAt(string,uint256) (src/BioPassportRegistry.sol#803-889) uses timestamp for comparisons\n\tDangerous comparisons:\n\t- mat.status == MaterialStatus.REVOKED (src/BioPassportRegistry.sol#812-813)\n\t- mat.status == MaterialStatus.QUARANTINED (src/BioPassportRegistry.sol#816)\n\t- issuerWasRevokedBeforeIssuance = (issuerRevokeTime != 0 && cred.issuedAt >= issuerRevokeTime) (src/BioPassportRegistry.sol#840-843)\n\t- cred.credType == CredentialType.IDENTITY && ! cred.revoked && ! issuerWasRevokedBeforeIssuance (src/BioPassportRegistry.sol#843-846)\n\t- hasValidQC = (latestQcIssuedAt != 0 && latestQcValidUntil >= atTime && ! latestQcFromRevokedIssuer) (src/BioPassportRegistry.sol#860-863)\n",
            "markdown": "[BioPassportRegistry._verifyMaterialAt(string,uint256)](src/BioPassportRegistry.sol#L803-L889) uses timestamp for comparisons\n\tDangerous comparisons:\n\t- [mat.status == MaterialStatus.REVOKED](src/BioPassportRegistry.sol#L812-L813)\n\t- [mat.status == MaterialStatus.QUARANTINED](src/BioPassportRegistry.sol#L816)\n\t- [issuerWasRevokedBeforeIssuance = (issuerRevokeTime != 0 && cred.issuedAt >= issuerRevokeTime)](src/BioPassportRegistry.sol#L840-L843)\n\t- [cred.credType == CredentialType.IDENTITY && ! cred.revoked && ! issuerWasRevokedBeforeIssuance](src/BioPassportRegistry.sol#L843-L846)\n\t- [hasValidQC = (latestQcIssuedAt != 0 && latestQcValidUntil >= atTime && ! latestQcFromRevokedIssuer)](src/BioPassportRegistry.sol#L860-L863)\n"
